          "type": "UBodySetup*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "=============================================================================\nStaticMeshImportUtils.h: Static mesh import functions.\n============================================================================="
    },
    {
      "id": "add-box-geom-from-tris",
      "name": "AddBoxGeomFromTris",
      "category": "StaticMeshImportUtils",
      "signature": "AddBoxGeomFromTris(Tris, Agg Geom, Obj Name)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Tris",
          "type": "TArray<FPoly>&"
        },
        {
          "name": "Agg Geom",
          "type": "FKAggregateGeom*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Obj Name",
          "type": "TCHAR*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Function for adding a box collision primitive to the supplied collision geometry based on the mesh of the box.\nWe keep a list of triangle normals found so far. For each normal direction,\nwe should have 2 distances from the origin (2 parallel box faces). If the\nmesh is a box, we should have 3 distinct normal directions, and 2 distances\nfound for each. The difference between these distances should be the box\ndimensions. The 3 directions give us the key axes, and therefore the\nbox transformation matrix. This shouldn't rely on any vertex-ordering on\nthe triangles (normals are compared +ve & -ve). It also shouldn't matter\nabout how many triangles make up each side (but it will take longer).\nWe get the centre of the box from the centre of its AABB."
    },
    {
      "id": "add-sphere-geom-from-verts",
      "name": "AddSphereGeomFromVerts",
      "category": "StaticMeshImportUtils",
      "signature": "AddSphereGeomFromVerts(Verts, Agg Geom, Obj Name)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Verts",
          "type": "TArray<FVector3f>&"
        },
        {
          "name": "Agg Geom",
          "type": "FKAggregateGeom*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Obj Name",
          "type": "TCHAR*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Function for adding a sphere collision primitive to the supplied collision geometry based on a set of Verts.\nSimply put an AABB around mesh and use that to generate center and radius.\nIt checks that the AABB is square, and that all vertices are either at the\ncenter, or within 5% of the radius distance away."
    },
